。背景やポーズ等はお任せいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ukkaritanuki/works/48", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/06885184/uploads/origins/b4725db1-9fee-45f9-96c2-af95ebdd817d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3000e75e501b5be1a649574efc843a31", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/06885184/uploads/origins/b4725db1-9fee-45f9-96c2-af95ebdd817d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3000e75e501b5be1a649574efc843a31, https://si.imgix.net/06885184/uploads/origins/b4725db1-9fee-45f9-96c2-af95ebdd817d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e1b95b6d797ab3b3a8762075f9129cd5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/06885184/uploads/origins/b4725db1-9fee-45f9-96c2-af95ebdd817d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ee6707b0c3175958177bcd7d6982829 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "リクエスト失礼致します！\n戦狗獣吼シバリオンのキャラであるるっちくんと祭狸くんがもし獣吠した姿が見てみたいです！\nお互いに理性は保った状態で洗脳はされてないと嬉しいです！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ukkaritanuki/works/47", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/49027e01/uploads/origins/58103852-5041-482d-a4ac-e03b76221da4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=12e16e64c387907f92ba19fb6d9e95dc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/49027e01/uploads/origins/58103852-5041-482d-a4ac-e03b76221da4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=12e16e64c387907f92ba19fb6d9e95dc, https://si.imgix.net/49027e01/uploads/origins/58103852-5041-482d-a4ac-e03b76221da4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=713dc2d9f19de387583